// In the unconstrained phase, it generates tokens without grammar constraints until it encounters "<<".
// Upon encountering "<<", it switches to the constrained phase and continues generating tokens according to the given grammar until it reaches ">>" or completes the sentence.
// If ">>" is encountered during the constrained phase, it switches back to the unconstrained phase.
// The strategy aims to find a valid logical conclusion or determine if it's unknown within the given token limit.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END

